#. module: l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
msgid ""
"\n"
"Slovak specifics on top of the Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 e-invoice of Odoo, for the\n"
"mandatory domestic e-invoicing that starts on 1 January 2027 (Act No. 385/2025\n"
"amending the VAT Act No. 222/2004).\n"
"\n"
"The module is documented in doc/documentation_en.md (English) and\n"
"doc/documentation_sk.md (Slovak). The legal sources of the rules are listed in\n"
"docs/legislation_en.md and docs/legislation_sk.md of the repository.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_edi_einvoice/models/account_edi_xml_ubl_bis3.py:0
msgid ""
"%(partner)s has no VAT number (IC DPH). A supplier that is not registered "
"for VAT can only invoice with taxes of the category 'O - Services outside "
"scope of tax'."
msgstr ""
"%(partner)s nemá IČ DPH. Dodavatel, který není plátcem DPH, může fakturovat "
"pouze s daněmi kategorie „O - Services outside scope of tax“."

#. module: l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_edi_einvoice/models/account_edi_xml_ubl_bis3.py:0
msgid ""
"%(partner)s must be identified by its tax identification number (DIC, 10 "
"digits): Slovak entities send and receive e-invoices under the Peppol "
"identifier 0245:DIC. Fill in the DIC on the contact and select it as the "
"routing identifier."
msgstr ""
"%(partner)s musí být identifikován daňovým identifikačním číslem (DIČ, 10 "
"číslic): slovenské subjekty odesílají a přijímají elektronické faktury pod "
"identifikátorem Peppol 0245:DIČ. Doplňte DIČ na kontaktu a vyberte ho jako "
"směrovací identifikátor."

